ODDitee w/Night Rider 87, Michael Weber & special guest DreamReaper
Twilight Cafe & Bar, Portland, OR
May 16th, 2025

@pacificnorthwave proudly presented and sponsored its "first" live event with PNWC members @odditee_ , @nightridermusic & @michael_j_weber with a very special surprise appearance from @dreamreapermusic! 

The night was filled with nearly all members of the PNWC, friends, family and local supporters of the Synth community, all congregating at @twilightcafeandbar

@michael_j_weber started off the night with smooth and funky Italo-Disco/Businesswave tracks and accompanied them with his retro monitor visuals. Playing notable tracks from his 'Omakase' album.

@nightridermusic followed up with their high octane and gritty Cyberpunk performance welcoming a surprise guest appearance from @dreamreapermusic performing their collab "Fever Machine"

@odditee_ closed the night with unbridled energy and a unique blend of synths, drums, vocals and a showstopping keytar performance. Ending the show with the titular track off his recent EP release on @rosso.corsa.records "Everlasting"

We thank each and every one of you who attended and helped make this debut unforgettable for not only @odditee_ but all of us in the PNWC. We hope you enjoyed and had a great experience!

Be sure to look out for our next sponsored event with @danielquasar and our bi-monthly SynthCadia nights!

