Sunday, 25th October, the last day of Slidetoberfest 2026.⁠ We're bringing back the spirit of Swank Rally to Pangkung Tibah Beach.⁠
⁠
The engines start roaring at 9AM, with Los Brengos keeping the tunes rolling.⁠ Then, from 4PM, we're heading back to The Deus Temple of Enthusiasm for one hell of a Wrap Party.⁠
⁠
And what better way to close out three days of madness than with The Panturas taking over the temple? Bringing their signature surf rock sound, turning the final night of Slidetoberfest into one you won't forget.⁠
⁠
Joining the celebration are Millenials, Lizad, Satva, Soul and Kith, and Aesthetic City Club, alongside Yuniorika spinning vinyl, visual mapping by Obscura, and community activations throughout the evening.⁠
⁠
It's the final day of Slidetoberfest 2026. Make it unforgettable.⁠
