We're taking over the black sands of Pasut Beach for another round of Slidetober Dress Up Drag Race's. Strange costumes, loud machines, and grown adults making questionable decisions at full throttle.⁠
⁠
When the dust settles, the afternoon & evening continues at The Deus Temple of Enthusiasm with the opening night exhibition by our Slidetober artist - Andre Yoga, along with a host of bands, DJ's, and community activations. ⁠
